# Copy this file to .env only if you are building the app yourself.
#
# ============================================================
# API keys are NOT configured here any more
# ============================================================
# The app no longer reads any key from the build environment. A key compiled into
# a Vite bundle is published on the internet - VITE_* values are inlined into
# dist/ and were verifiably readable there.
#
# Instead, the user enters their own keys in the app:
#   Settings (gear icon) > API KEYS (THIS DEVICE)
#     - Google Gemini API Key  -> online diagnosis
#     - Google Maps API Key    -> district risk map
#
# They are stored in that browser's localStorage on that device only. Nothing is
# sent to any server and nothing is bundled.
#
# If you previously set VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY or VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY here or in
# your hosting provider, delete them and rotate both keys - they were public.

# ============================================================
# Training the offline model
# ============================================================
# Nothing here either: the notebook (notebooks/KrishiSetu_Model_Training.ipynb)
# takes its Kaggle credentials, dataset choices and hyperparameters in Step 0.
# See MODEL_PLAN.md for the model design and ppt.md for the presentation outline.
